<description>&lt;p&gt;Protests in Iraq have turned deadly, with four people killed and many wounded, while armed factions such as Kata'ib Hezbollah threaten to join a war if Iran is attacked and accuse the Iraqi prime minister and coordination framework of corruption in the PMF law. Iran has launched missile strikes in Iraq and Syria, prompting US condemnation and statements of readiness to assist Erbil, and Iran is developing a missile capable of reaching Europe. The Iraqi prime minister ordered increased power and fuel supplies to Kirkuk, and energy deals with Iran involving Iraq and Pakistan were signed as Tehran flexes Hormuz control. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5lWXNHQWIwS1l3cDl0VXR3ekdNS1cyeFA4c3hKQmpnZkFRYXBNS0dxSllDV2oyNnJkRklncXB4RnpqV1ByY2QtWlFEYkowNl93RFd1V2JkakhXeVJQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNR3ZLUlhQbG9kWmxwVzZZajFLUXVOQ1FJcC14MWN4aHVNemxTaWhvXzFkenVabUdUakkzX01lSG4ydnhuSXBoamM3UVFzeWRqb3VhUzVJNkRJby1HV0RTVnpsa01SY2JPS1NmalkzVnRuNmFmQ0hZMjRtQ04tdllvTFVLYmstMTl2NW5UZUJKci1TcVE0MlBPR2k0WVZuUUpxQ2d0cHB3MjF1cEpNVXVCREdheFoxM3J1X01KRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOZlVraGYyaU5HYmxKMVQ2SkIyWHZnMThMVUVoajJTclN3N2xYZF9iYVVMSXVHOTVzV3lZUGdpQUxxOXRUdDhiWVROX2RwTVVuNGc2a2c0SXR0eE5PR2g2VTc2dUl6OUNIQ2NadG5NbU0zSXBnQ0ZNVnNka2lFN3l3eEpPN2stMjRURFlBQW11VktXa2p4S1cyRnc4UXRRT2FqeEM0eVR2WGZBWnVZSXNRWDNMZllncnk1Vmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Insight International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTFBTRjVqdHN5azVZVTcyMnJNNkQwdVJIRjZGNXh3alVHa29tZG11RV96RkQ4WFJZVUtsX0pvbHlDdHJoUUpwZHF3WGQzMW9pbEVKN2dTQmtONFNpRkRTeWpoWmdXTWl2S25XNDl